{"diagnosis": "SLTIU with U1REG=5000 and imm=-1 wrote datao=00000000 instead of expected datao=00000001 (x3 must be 1). Unsigned compare U1REG < U2REGX used zero-extended UIMM=4095, so 5000<4095 is false. Root cause is line 531 where U2REGX selects UIMM when XMCC is set; it must select sign-extended SIMM (0xFFFFFFFF) so 5000<4294967295 is true unsigned.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/rtl/darkriscv.v b/rtl/darkriscv.v
--- a/rtl/darkriscv.v
+++ b/rtl/darkriscv.v
@@ -530,3 +530,3 @@
     wire signed [31:0] S2REGX = XMCC ? SIMM : S2REG;
-    wire        [31:0] U2REGX = XMCC ? UIMM : U2REG;
+    wire        [31:0] U2REGX = XMCC ? SIMM : U2REG;

", "expected": "tohost: PASS 0x1 with datao=00000001 (x3=1, 5000 < 0xFFFFFFFF unsigned true)"}

